under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

The site and validation code are licensed under MIT; see LICENSE-CODE.
AI-generated editorial covers are shared under CC BY 4.0 to the extent that
