Referenced papers, repositories, models, weights and datasets retain their own
licenses. A citation does not grant permission to redistribute or use them.
No third-party paper text, figures, models or datasets are included.

IBM Plex font binaries in docs/assets/fonts/ retain the SIL Open Font License
1.1 and bundled IBM copyright notices. DVIDIA's name and visor mark identify
the platform; the code and content licenses do not grant trademark rights.
